{"seq":2,"slug":"analytics-attribution","title":"分析与归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/analytics-attribution","wordCount":998,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分析与归因\">分析与归因</h1><p>深链不只是技术路由工具，它还是营销归因的核心信号载体。UTM 参数标记流量来源，归因模型将用户行为（安装、购买、注册）归因到对应渠道，SKAN（iOS）和 Google Play Install Referrer（Android）则是平台级的隐私保护归因方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>UTM 参数</strong>：通过 <code>utm_source</code>、<code>utm_medium</code>、<code>utm_campaign</code> 等标准参数在 URL 中携带流量来源信息，App 打开时提取并传递给分析平台</li>\n<li><strong>Last-Click 归因</strong>：行业默认模型，将安装/转化归因到最后一次点击的渠道，Branch / AppsFlyer SDK 均默认此模型</li>\n<li><strong>SKAN（SKAdNetwork）</strong>：iOS 14.5+ 的隐私保护归因框架，Apple 作为中间方收集聚合数据后再发给广告网络，不包含用户级数据，最多 3 次回调且有随机延迟</li>\n<li><strong>Install Referrer（Android）</strong>：Google Play 提供的确定性归因 API，通过 <code>InstallReferrerClient</code> 读取安装来源的 UTM 参数，比指纹归因更准确</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"深链中的-utm-参数\">深链中的 UTM 参数</h2><p>UTM（Urchin Tracking Module）参数是跟踪流量来源的标准方式，深链 URL 中的 UTM 参数需要在 App 打开时被提取并传递给分析工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"https://example.com/product/123?&#10;    utm_source=facebook&amp;&#10;    utm_medium=cpc&amp;&#10;    utm_campaign=summer_sale_2026&amp;&#10;    utm_content=product_banner&amp;&#10;    utm_term=smartphone_deal\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>https://example.com/product/123?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    utm_source=facebook&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    utm_medium=cpc&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    utm_campaign=summer_sale_2026&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    utm_content=product_banner&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    utm_term=smartphone_deal</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>UTM 参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>utm_source</code></td>\n<td>流量来源平台</td>\n<td><code>facebook</code>、<code>google</code>、<code>email</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>utm_medium</code></td>\n<td>营销媒介类型</td>\n<td><code>cpc</code>、<code>organic</code>、<code>push</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>utm_campaign</code></td>\n<td>营销活动名称</td>\n<td><code>summer_sale_2026</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>utm_content</code></td>\n<td>广告创意标识</td>\n<td><code>product_banner_v2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>utm_term</code></td>\n<td>搜索关键词</td>\n<td><code>smartphone_deal</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 App 中提取 UTM 参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func extractUTMParameters(from url: URL) -&gt; [String: String] {&#10;    guard let components = URLComponents(url: url, resolvingAgainstBaseURL: false),&#10;          let queryItems = components.queryItems else {&#10;        return [:]&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let utmKeys = [&quot;utm_source&quot;, &quot;utm_medium&quot;, &quot;utm_campaign&quot;, &quot;utm_content&quot;, &quot;utm_term&quot;]&#10;    return Dictionary(&#10;        uniqueKeysWithValues: queryItems&#10;            .filter { utmKeys.contains($0.name) }&#10;            .compactMap { item in&#10;                guard let value = item.value else { return nil }&#10;                return (item.name, value)&#10;            }&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractUTMParameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url: URL) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URLComponents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: url, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">resolvingAgainstBaseURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryItems </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components.queryItems </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utmKeys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utm_source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utm_medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utm_campaign\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utm_content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utm_term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Dictionary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        uniqueKeysWithValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: queryItems</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { utmKeys.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">compactMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.name, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"归因模型\">归因模型</h2><p>用户可能在多个渠道接触广告后才完成安装，归因模型决定哪个渠道获得&quot;功劳&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Facebook 广告点击] --&gt; B[Google 搜索] --&gt; C[邮件链接点击] --&gt; D[App 安装]\">graph LR\n    A[Facebook 广告点击] --&gt; B[Google 搜索] --&gt; C[邮件链接点击] --&gt; D[App 安装]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归因模型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Last-Click（末次点击）</td>\n<td>安装前最后一次点击获得100%归因</td>\n<td>简单、直接，行业最常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>First-Click（首次点击）</td>\n<td>第一次接触获得100%归因</td>\n<td>品牌认知活动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linear（线性）</td>\n<td>每个接触点平分归因</td>\n<td>多渠道综合评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Time Decay（时间衰减）</td>\n<td>越近的接触点权重越高</td>\n<td>转化周期较短的产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data-Driven（数据驱动）</td>\n<td>基于统计模型分配权重</td>\n<td>数据量充足的大型 App</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Last-Click 是深链 SDK（Branch、AppsFlyer）的默认模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mta-多触点归因\">MTA（多触点归因）</h2><p>多触点归因（Multi-Touch Attribution）需要在用户的多次接触中保持标识符的一致性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant FB as Facebook 广告&#10;    participant Email as 邮件链接&#10;    participant App as App&#10;    participant MTA as 归因服务&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;FB: 点击广告(携带 fbclid)&#10;    FB-&gt;&gt;MTA: 记录接触点 1:source=facebook, fbclid=xxx&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Email: 3天后点击邮件链接&#10;    Email-&gt;&gt;MTA: 记录接触点 2:source=email_campaign&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;App: 安装并首次打开&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;MTA: 发送安装事件 + 设备 ID&#10;    MTA-&gt;&gt;MTA: 关联历史接触点,计算归因权重&#10;    MTA-&gt;&gt;App: 返回归因数据\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant FB as Facebook 广告\n    participant Email as 邮件链接\n    participant App as App\n    participant MTA as 归因服务\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;FB: 点击广告(携带 fbclid)\n    FB-&gt;&gt;MTA: 记录接触点 1:source=facebook, fbclid=xxx\n    User-&gt;&gt;Email: 3天后点击邮件链接\n    Email-&gt;&gt;MTA: 记录接触点 2:source=email_campaign\n    User-&gt;&gt;App: 安装并首次打开\n    App-&gt;&gt;MTA: 发送安装事件 + 设备 ID\n    MTA-&gt;&gt;MTA: 关联历史接触点,计算归因权重\n    MTA-&gt;&gt;App: 返回归因数据</pre><h2 id=\"ios-skan-skadnetwork-归因框架\">iOS SKAN（SKAdNetwork）归因框架</h2><p>iOS 14.5 之后，ATT 使基于 IDFA 的确定性归因大幅受限，Apple 推出了 SKAdNetwork（SKAN）作为隐私保护的广告归因替代方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户点击广告] --&gt; B[广告网络记录 Click]&#10;    B --&gt; C[用户安装 App]&#10;    C --&gt; D[App 调用 updateConversionValue]&#10;    D --&gt; E[等待随机延迟 24-48h]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Apple 向广告网络发送归因回调]&#10;    F --&gt; G[归因数据:Campaign ID + Conversion Value]\">graph LR\n    A[用户点击广告] --&gt; B[广告网络记录 Click]\n    B --&gt; C[用户安装 App]\n    C --&gt; D[App 调用 updateConversionValue]\n    D --&gt; E[等待随机延迟 24-48h]\n    E --&gt; F[Apple 向广告网络发送归因回调]\n    F --&gt; G[归因数据:Campaign ID + Conversion Value]</pre><p>SKAN 的核心限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>SKAN 3</th>\n<th>SKAN 4（iOS 16.1+）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Campaign 数量</td>\n<td>100 个</td>\n<td>1000 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conversion Value</td>\n<td>6 bit（0-63）</td>\n<td>细粒度 + 粗粒度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回调延迟</td>\n<td>24-48 小时</td>\n<td>最多 3 次，延迟更长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户级数据</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>updateConversionValue</code> 的使用方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import StoreKit&#10;&#10;// 记录关键转化事件（如完成注册、首次购买）&#10;if #available(iOS 15.4, *) {&#10;    // SKAN 4：支持细粒度和粗粒度&#10;    SKAdNetwork.updatePostbackConversionValue(&#10;        fineValue: 15,    // 0-63，表示具体行为&#10;        coarseValue: .high,  // low/medium/high&#10;        lockWindow: false&#10;    ) { error in&#10;        if let error = error {&#10;            print(&quot;SKAN update failed: \\(error)&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;} else {&#10;    // SKAN 3&#10;    SKAdNetwork.updateConversionValue(15)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StoreKit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 记录关键转化事件（如完成注册、首次购买）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> #available</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">iOS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 15.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // SKAN 4：支持细粒度和粗粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SKAdNetwork.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">updatePostbackConversionValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        fineValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0-63，表示具体行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        coarseValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .high,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// low/medium/high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        lockWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) { error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKAN update failed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(error)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // SKAN 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SKAdNetwork.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">updateConversionValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"google-play-install-referrer\">Google Play Install Referrer</h2><p>Android 通过 Install Referrer API 追踪从 Google Play 安装的归因来源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import com.android.installreferrer.api.InstallReferrerClient&#10;import com.android.installreferrer.api.InstallReferrerStateListener&#10;&#10;class InstallReferrerManager(private val context: Context) {&#10;&#10;    fun fetchInstallReferrer(onResult: (String?) -&gt; Unit) {&#10;        val referrerClient = InstallReferrerClient.newBuilder(context).build()&#10;&#10;        referrerClient.startConnection(object : InstallReferrerStateListener {&#10;            override fun onInstallReferrerSetupFinished(responseCode: Int) {&#10;                if (responseCode == InstallReferrerClient.InstallReferrerResponse.OK) {&#10;                    val referrer = referrerClient.installReferrer.installReferrer&#10;                    onResult(referrer)&#10;                    referrerClient.endConnection()&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            override fun onInstallReferrerServiceDisconnected() {&#10;                onResult(null)&#10;            }&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import com.android.installreferrer.api.InstallReferrerClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import com.android.installreferrer.api.InstallReferrerStateListener</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class InstallReferrerManager(private val context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun fetchInstallReferrer(onResult: (String?) -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val referrerClient = InstallReferrerClient.newBuilder(context).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        referrerClient.startConnection(object : InstallReferrerStateListener {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun onInstallReferrerSetupFinished(responseCode: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (responseCode == InstallReferrerClient.InstallReferrerResponse.OK) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    val referrer = referrerClient.installReferrer.installReferrer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onResult(referrer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    referrerClient.endConnection()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun onInstallReferrerServiceDisconnected() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onResult(null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Install Referrer 字符串格式与 UTM 参数相同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=summer_sale\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>utm_source=google&#x26;utm_medium=cpc&#x26;utm_campaign=summer_sale</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"深链事件追踪\">深链事件追踪</h2><p>深链触发的关键事件应该被发送到分析平台，形成完整的用户行为漏斗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件名</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>必要属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>deep_link_opened</code></td>\n<td>深链成功打开 App 时</td>\n<td><code>link_url</code>、<code>source</code>、<code>campaign</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deep_link_routing_failed</code></td>\n<td>路由解析失败时</td>\n<td><code>link_url</code>、<code>failure_reason</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deferred_deep_link_matched</code></td>\n<td>延迟深链成功匹配时</td>\n<td><code>original_link</code>、<code>match_confidence</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deep_link_timeout</code></td>\n<td>延迟深链查询超时</td>\n<td><code>timeout_ms</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>深链归因的工程实践要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>UTM 参数标准化</strong>：在团队内统一 UTM 参数的命名规范（source/medium/campaign），避免不同渠道使用不一致的参数名导致数据碎片化</li>\n<li><strong>iOS 双轨并行</strong>：ATT 授权后使用确定性 IDFA 归因，未授权时用 SKAN 聚合数据，两套结果分别上报并在分析平台合并</li>\n<li><strong>SKAN Conversion Value 规划</strong>：6 bit（0-63）的 Conversion Value 需要提前规划用于表达哪些业务事件（注册=1，首单=2，复购=3...），规划一旦上线后难以修改</li>\n<li><strong>Install Referrer 及时读取</strong>：Android Install Referrer API 的数据在 App 卸载重装后会清空，必须在首次启动时读取并持久化</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"deep-link-testing\">深链测试</a> 介绍如何验证归因数据是否被正确采集；<a href=\"link-migration-versioning\">迁移与版本管理</a> 介绍归因数据在链接变更期间的延续策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分析与归因","id":"分析与归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"深链中的 UTM 参数","id":"深链中的-utm-参数"},{"level":2,"text":"归因模型","id":"归因模型"},{"level":2,"text":"MTA（多触点归因）","id":"mta-多触点归因"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS SKAN（SKAdNetwork）归因框架","id":"ios-skan-skadnetwork-归因框架"},{"level":2,"text":"Google Play Install Referrer","id":"google-play-install-referrer"},{"level":2,"text":"深链事件追踪","id":"深链事件追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"深链测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/deep-link-testing"},"next":{"title":"迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/link-migration-versioning"}}